   101	## 2. Proposition LV6
   102	
   103	**Proposition LV6 [proved, given the cited theorems listed in §3].**
   104	- **Hypotheses.**
   105	  - Fix odd d ≥ 3 and k.
   106	  - N > N₀(d, k) has been preprocessed.
   107	  - The field passes the checks of §4: gcd(g₁ t, N) = 1, f irreducible and primitive, and ψ(g′(β)) is a unit
