   190	### 3.3 Character columns: Lemma X
   191	
   192	For 0 ≠ h ∈ H, let L_h := K(√h), so [L_h : Q] = 2d.
   193	
   194	**Discriminant bound [proved].** |Δ_{L_h}| ≤ Δ̄ := |disc g|²·8^d·|D|^d.
   195	- Δ_{L_h} = Δ_K²·N_{K/Q}(𝔡_{L_h/K}).
   196	- Take a representative γ ∈ V_D. At 𝔓 ∤ 2D, ord_𝔓γ is even, so after removing a local square L_h/K is unramified
