   441	
   442	| LV §6 item | LV (d ≍ (log N)^{1/3}, heights L(1/3)) | here (fixed d, height N^{1/(4k)}) |
   443	|---|---|---|
   444	| |H| bound | Claim 6.5 via BLP Prop 7.4, √\|Δ_g\|(log n)^{O(d)} | Lemma H, 2^{dω(D)+d}h_K = N^{O(1)} |
   445	| characters | Lemma 6.6: L(1/3)-size primes, sampler Υ, probability ≥ 1/(2d) | Lemma X: exp(O((log N)²))-size first-degree primes, uniform sampler, ≥ 1/(5d) |
   446	| Siegel zeros | Lemma 6.10: ≤ (4/3) log log n classes, except an L(2/3)^{−…} set of f | Lemma E: ≤ 1 class, every f |
   447	| pigeonhole | ℓ = (4/3) log log n repetitions, (ℓ choose 2) tests | 3 tests |
