- **Consequences.** Infimum over k: (1 + 3/(d+1))/√2, i.e. 0.9723 (d = 7), 0.9192 (d = 9), 0.8839
  (d = 11) and 0.8132 (d = 19). The constant is < 1 iff d ≥ 7, with k ≥ 13 (d = 7) or k ≥ 12 (d = 9).
