The separation condition at \(q\) uses only lower fibre bounds.

Choose \(w=L_{v^2}[2/3,c_1]\) for a guess \(v\ge p\). Double \(v\), allocating trials proportional to
\[
(\log n)^6\exp((\log(v^2))^{1/3}(\log\log(v^2))^{8/3}).
\]
